{"unit_id":"1790bc3dd892cd354f06","title":"提案六、有關糖尿病用藥審查注意事項之審核共識，提請討論。","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p6-b14","raw_text":"提案六、有關糖尿病用藥審查注意事項之審核共識，提請討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":30,"bbox":[36.0,512.7696533203125,487.9499816894531,530.4373779296875]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p6-b15","raw_text":"說明: \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,548.7696533203125,76.4939956665039,566.4373779296875]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p6-b16","raw_text":"1. 在無禁忌或不能耐受情形下Metformin 應為第一線用藥。其使用期間 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[57.263999938964844,584.7696533203125,562.8300170898438,602.4373779296875]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p6-b17","raw_text":"eGFR <45 應減量、 eGFR <30 禁用。 在有禁忌或不能耐受Metformin\n","start_char":0,"end_char":46,"bbox":[78.6240005493164,620.7996826171875,559.2192993164062,638.4674072265625]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p6-b18","raw_text":"情形下，尊重臨床醫師對口服降血糖藥物的選擇。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":24,"bbox":[78.6240005493164,656.7996826171875,434.5299987792969,674.4674072265625]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p6-b19","raw_text":"2. TZD 製劑、 DPP-4 inhibitor、 SGLT-2 inhibitor， 此三類藥物限用於\n","start_char":0,"end_char":55,"bbox":[57.263999938964844,692.7996826171875,551.4751586914062,710.4674072265625]},{"page":6,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p6-b20","raw_text":"已接受Metformin 使用劑量達1000 mg/day 三個月以上，且HbA1C 仍\n","start_char":0,"end_char":45,"bbox":[78.38400268554688,728.795654296875,559.3200073242188,746.46337890625]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p7-b1","raw_text":"大於等於7 之第二型糖尿病病人。對Metformin 有使用禁忌或不能耐\n","start_char":0,"end_char":37,"bbox":[78.38400268554688,44.699623107910156,555.6751708984375,62.36734390258789]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p7-b2","raw_text":"受者，不在此限。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":10,"bbox":[78.38400268554688,80.71964263916016,210.32000732421875,98.38735961914062]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p7-b3","raw_text":"3. SGLT-2 inhibitor 不得與DPP-4 inhibitor 或 GLP-1 受體促效劑併用，每\n","start_char":0,"end_char":57,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,116.71964263916016,559.4400024414062,134.38735961914062]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p7-b4","raw_text":"天限處方一粒。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":9,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,152.71963500976562,187.40000915527344,170.38735961914062]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p7-b5","raw_text":"決議：通過上述說明1、2、3 點，另有關胰島素治療注意事項： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[36.0,188.71963500976562,487.9499816894531,206.38735961914062]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p7-b6","raw_text":"1. Basal  insulin 合併使用口服降血糖藥物，仍依健保署公告，以四\n","start_char":0,"end_char":41,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,224.49620056152344,557.8803100585938,242.38735961914062]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p7-b7","raw_text":"種為限。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":6,"bbox":[106.94000244140625,260.7496032714844,174.9199981689453,278.4173278808594]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p7-b8","raw_text":"2. 加強性胰島素治療(每天3~4 次以上之胰島素注射)應可減少口服\n","start_char":0,"end_char":35,"bbox":[85.7040023803711,296.52618408203125,550.283447265625,314.4173278808594]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p7-b9","raw_text":"降血糖藥物的種類和劑量，如Sulfonylureas 及Glinide。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":38,"bbox":[106.94000244140625,332.7496032714844,499.8299865722656,350.4173278808594]},{"page":7,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p7-b10","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,369.4696044921875,39.9900016784668,387.1373291015625]}],"source_quality":[]}